1367
00:04:08,870 --> 00:04:09,950
Let's go.

1368
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:32,770
That kid is your son, right?

1369
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:42,900
My job is to deliver this ship to Poliador.

1370
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:46,490
It's not to give your son a little lesson.

1371
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:56,290
I deposited 100 million into your account.

1372
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:58,920
Please do go teach my son a lesson.

1373
00:05:02,170 --> 00:05:03,380
This way.

1374
00:05:05,550 --> 00:05:06,800
Where are you going?

1375
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:09,300
There was a lifeboat near the bridge.

1376
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:11,470
We're going to escape using that.

1377
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:15,940
What are you doing?

1378
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:18,150
I have to see Shigemaru Kambe.

1379
00:05:18,150 --> 00:05:22,030
Give me a break already! You have to stay alive
if you want to fight another day.

1380
00:05:27,030 --> 00:05:28,910
Mr. Daisuke.

1381
00:05:28,910 --> 00:05:32,620
Why in the world was the ASV nullified?

1382
00:05:34,950 --> 00:05:37,290
This is the engine room?

1383
00:05:39,330 --> 00:05:41,540
How does this ship...

1384
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,760
Stop.

1385
00:05:51,760 --> 00:05:53,060
What's the matter?

1386
00:05:53,060 --> 00:05:55,060
Let's rest a bit.

1387
00:05:55,060 --> 00:05:57,480
Are you showing consideration for me?

1388
00:06:00,940 --> 00:06:04,780
I've been thinking about this for a while,
but your shoes...

1389
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:06,990
Are they elevator shoes--

1390
00:06:18,210 --> 00:06:19,710
What is it?

1391
00:06:22,710 --> 00:06:24,090
What are we going to do?

1392
00:06:29,930 --> 00:06:32,890
I will rescue you right away, Mr. Daisuke.

1393
00:06:39,480 --> 00:06:41,860
Approximately 20 drones are approaching.

1394
00:06:41,860 --> 00:06:43,940
Shooting them down with lasers.

1395
00:07:12,220 --> 00:07:14,550
They've all been shot down.

1396
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:30,570
What's wrong?

1397
00:07:30,570 --> 00:07:31,700
JJ reporting.

1398
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:33,820
Intruders spotted in the rear corridor

1399
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:36,580
of the third deck.

1400
00:07:36,580 --> 00:07:37,830
Apprehend them.

1401
00:07:37,830 --> 00:07:39,160
Roger that.

1402
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:48,460
Come on, if you don't run away
fast enough, I'll catch up!

1403
00:07:57,180 --> 00:07:58,680
What are you doing?

1404
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:01,730
Ow...

1405
00:08:08,610 --> 00:08:10,400
All right, we're going to make it.

1406
00:08:13,780 --> 00:08:16,450
They're planning on using the lifeboat.

1407
00:08:22,710 --> 00:08:23,960
They're coming.

1408
00:08:31,130 --> 00:08:33,550
How do you open this?

1409
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,440
Mr. Daisuke... please run...

1410
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,230
They're waiting to ambush you!

1411
00:08:46,190 --> 00:08:47,400
It opened!

1412
00:08:52,650 --> 00:08:54,700
Damn it. After them!

1413
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:02,200
How did you know it was an ambush?

1414
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,210
Logically thinking,
shouldn't you say thank you first?

1415
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:06,580
But you didn't say it!

1416
00:09:06,580 --> 00:09:08,460
Suzue, can you hear me?

1417
00:09:08,460 --> 00:09:10,300
Where'd you get that?

1418
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:11,880
Yes, I can hear you.

1419
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:14,380
Why can't I use the ASV?

1420
00:09:14,380 --> 00:09:16,970
An unknown substance is interfering.

1421
00:09:16,970 --> 00:09:21,310
I believe it is adollium
that your parents were researching.

1422
00:09:21,310 --> 00:09:23,600
How do I stop the interference?

1423
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:27,270
The total displacement of this ship
is roughly 120,000 tons,

1424
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:31,690
but the engine noise is extremely quiet,
and it's not emitting any exhaust fumes.

1425
00:09:31,690 --> 00:09:37,660
The power source of the ship may be adollium,
just like what is nullifying your equipment.

1426
00:09:37,660 --> 00:09:40,030
This must be it. The engine room.

1427
00:09:40,030 --> 00:09:42,580
If they find us,
we're caught like rats in a trap.

1428
00:09:43,620 --> 00:09:45,000
Enemies approaching.

1429
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,080
Please get away from there!

1430
00:09:48,330 --> 00:09:51,710
If they try to resist,
you can just kill them off.

1431
00:09:51,710 --> 00:09:53,880
However, our client...

1432
00:09:53,880 --> 00:09:56,800
I don't care about their circumstances.

1433
00:10:00,050 --> 00:10:03,180
What are you going to do? If you're
going to the engine room, it'll be too--

1434
00:10:03,180 --> 00:10:05,020
I'll go alone.

1435
00:10:09,980 --> 00:10:11,150
I'll go with you.

1436
00:10:11,150 --> 00:10:13,690
You may be despicable,
but I can't just leave you to die and--

1437
00:10:13,690 --> 00:10:17,200
Go up onto the deck
and draw enemy attention.

1438
00:10:19,280 --> 00:10:20,700
Hurry up and go.

1439
00:10:22,100 --> 00:10:26,110
Fugou Keiji

1440
00:10:28,830 --> 00:10:31,960
Man, I always get stuck with this role!

1441
00:10:37,010 --> 00:10:38,170
There he is!

1442
00:10:46,680 --> 00:10:49,310
Please go down the stairs
20 meters ahead of you.

1443
00:10:49,310 --> 00:10:52,020
The engine room is at the bottom of the stairs.

1444
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:54,320
The fluctuation in the magnetic field
is getting stronger.

1445
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:59,780
It seems the energy source that is
nullifying the ASV is in the engine room.

1446
00:11:01,110 --> 00:11:02,240
Damn it!

1447
00:11:17,920 --> 00:11:19,760
This is the end for you.

1448
00:11:52,620 --> 00:11:54,040
What is that?

1449
00:11:54,040 --> 00:11:58,090
I believe it is a device
that can create energy using adollium.

1450
00:11:59,010 --> 00:12:04,180
By using adollium as the receptacle, it can
transform the mass from seawater into energy.

1451
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:06,510
And that is what's being used
as the power supply.

1452
00:12:06,510 --> 00:12:08,260
If used effectively,

1453
00:12:08,260 --> 00:12:11,690
it can become a perpetual motion machine
providing humanity with unlimited energy.

1454
00:12:11,690 --> 00:12:15,940
However, it can also become
a weapon that destroys the world.

1455
00:12:15,940 --> 00:12:18,320
Please look for the cooling unit.

1456
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,730
If you can stop that,

1457
00:12:19,730 --> 00:12:23,820
the energy supply to the device interfering
with the ASV should stop as well.

1458
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:37,130
Where is the cooling unit?

1459
00:12:52,350 --> 00:12:55,400
The output from the
jamming device is decreasing.

1460
00:12:57,150 --> 00:12:58,360
Enemies!

1461
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:05,280
Come out.

1462
00:13:06,610 --> 00:13:09,870
I'll take you over to where your dad is.

1463
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:27,840
I did get that money,

1464
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:30,430
so I have to teach you a lesson.

1465
00:13:38,980 --> 00:13:40,190
You're...

1466
00:13:44,860 --> 00:13:46,110
Kambe!

1467
00:13:49,370 --> 00:13:52,200
It's the red pipe! Shoot it!

1468
00:13:57,620 --> 00:13:59,420
What an annoying guy.

1469
00:14:07,130 --> 00:14:10,930
Why? Why do we hesitate to act for justice?

1470
00:14:10,930 --> 00:14:16,100
Weren't detectives supposed to be heroes
before they are civil servants?

1471
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:22,520
Two years ago, he no longer became able
to shoot a gun, and stopped being a hero.

1472
00:14:22,520 --> 00:14:24,440
But ever since you came...

1473
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:29,320
I'm just a civil servant.

1474
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:35,500
Give me a break.

1475
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:38,290
For all this time...

1476
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:43,340
...before being a civil servant...

1477
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:50,220
...you've been a hero.

1478
00:15:03,230 --> 00:15:08,360
Your job is to make justice happen,
Inspector Kato!

1479
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:10,280
I'll kill you!

1480
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:21,330
Bastard!

1481
00:16:12,050 --> 00:16:15,300
The ship is sinking! Please get back on deck!

1482
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:17,180
I have sent a helicopter your way!

1483
00:16:17,180 --> 00:16:20,520
Before that, give me the route to the bridge.

1484
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:21,270
However...

1485
00:16:21,270 --> 00:16:22,940
Give me the route.

1486
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:27,400
Don't worry. I will return home alive.

1487
00:16:29,900 --> 00:16:32,650
Understood.

1488
00:16:32,650 --> 00:16:34,570
Hey! Let's hurry up and go!

1489
00:16:34,570 --> 00:16:37,030
I have some business with Shigemaru Kambe.

1490
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,660
You're so hopeless.

1491
00:17:11,990 --> 00:17:14,700
The jammer cannot be used.

1492
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:17,570
He doesn't seem to have any firearms either.

1493
00:17:17,570 --> 00:17:20,580
Shigemaru... Kambe.

1494
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:26,120
It's been a while, Daisuke.

1495
00:17:27,130 --> 00:17:29,880
Inspector Kato. Handcuffs, please.

1496
00:17:36,470 --> 00:17:38,300
Shigemaru Kambe.

1497
00:17:41,600 --> 00:17:47,440
You are under arrest on charges for the murders
of Chosuke Nakamoto and Katsuhiro Takei.

1498
00:17:51,820 --> 00:17:56,200
This is a family matter.
You have nothing to do with it.

1499
00:17:56,200 --> 00:18:00,410
Does that mean you won't be involved
in this case as a detective?

