00:18:19,890 --> 00:18:22,680
Neutralize Daisuke, HEUSC.

1504
00:18:22,680 --> 00:18:23,810
As you wish.

1505
00:18:23,810 --> 00:18:25,310
Did you say HEUSC?

1506
00:18:26,480 --> 00:18:27,480
Hey!

1507
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:37,650
Please run away, Mr. Daisuke!

1508
00:18:37,650 --> 00:18:40,870
The ASV is showing temperatures
greatly above what it can withstand!

1509
00:19:07,180 --> 00:19:09,810
Bring the hoverbike on top of the bridge.

1510
00:19:09,810 --> 00:19:11,440
As you wish.

1511
00:19:31,080 --> 00:19:32,460
It's no use!

1512
00:19:32,460 --> 00:19:35,250
Damn it, why?

1513
00:19:35,250 --> 00:19:38,340
Why won't this come off?

1514
00:19:39,840 --> 00:19:41,510
Serves them right.

1515
00:19:41,510 --> 00:19:43,600
But we can't leave them like that.

1516
00:19:47,100 --> 00:19:49,980
That's the last of them.
I'm leaving you to take care of the rest.

1517
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:51,480
Yeah.

1518
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:53,190
Whoa, what's with his arm?

1519
00:19:53,190 --> 00:19:56,900
You sure nabbed another outrageous guy.

1520
00:19:56,900 --> 00:19:59,740
Kato! Where are you headed to?

1521
00:20:00,780 --> 00:20:04,570
We have to go catch the final boss who escaped!

1522
00:20:12,080 --> 00:20:15,090
So the hero has returned.

